        <article id="correct-mime" class="use-case">
          <div class="use-case-copy">
            <p class="use-case-coordinate">01 · Message structure</p>
            <h2>Build messages that render correctly.</h2>
            <p>Declare plain text, HTML, inline images, attachments, or calendar events and Simple Java Mail builds the MIME tree mail clients expect. Your code does not have to assemble multipart nesting, content IDs, transfer encoding, and transport plumbing by hand.</p>
          </div>
